rrect name, date, and comment. It does not appear on other restaurants' pages (only associated with Ember & Smoke).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied coupon WELCOME10 on reservation form; discount \\\"-10% off\\\" displayed with a remove control. Removed it successfully (coupon fields disappeared). Re-applied and submitted; the confirmed reservation in Upcoming list shows \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Date picker disabled all dates through Aug 25, 2026 (today) and enabled Aug 26 onward. Selected future date Aug 28, 2026 combined with an available time slot (19:00) from the restaurant's time list, and reservation was created successfully.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation date cannot be modified\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"Modify Reservation\\\" dialog for an upcoming reservation only offers \\\"New Time\\\" and \\\"Party Size\\\" fields (dialog text: \\\"Modify Reservation\\\\nNew Time\\\\n18:00\\\\nParty Size\\\\n2 Guests\\\\nSave Changes\\\\nClose\\\") — there is no date field. Changed time to 19:00 and party size to 4 Guests, saved successfully and the list reflected both changes immediately, but the date remained unchangeable, so users cannot modify an upcoming reservation's date.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reviews can be submitted without any completed reservation at the restaurant\", \"actual\": \"Navigated to Ember & Smoke restaurant page, which had no prior reservation of any kind by this user. Opened \\\"Write a Review\\\" and submitted a 5-star review with name, visit date, and comment with no prompt to select/verify an eligible completed reservation. The review was accepted immediately (review count went from (1) to (2) and the new review appeared in the list), demonstrating the app does not restrict reviews to restaurants covered by a completed reservation, nor limit one review per completed reservation.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon eligibility rules (day and first-reservation) are not enforced\", \"actual\": \"Party-size rule for GROUP15 correctly enforced: rejected silently at 2 guests, accepted with \\\"Coupon Applied! 15% off for parties of 6 or more\\\" at 6 guests. However, WEEKEND20 (stated as weekend-only, \\\"20% off weekend dining\\\") was accepted with a success toast on Aug 27, 2026, which is a Thursday (a weekday, verified via the date picker calendar layout where 23=Sun...29=Sat), violating the day-based eligibility rule. WELCOME10 was also successfully re-applied on a new reservation attempt despite the browsing session already having 2 prior reservations (one active, one cancelled) for this contact/email, indicating no \\\"first-reservation\\\" restriction is enforced. Only the party-size condition works correctly; the day and first-reservation conditions do not.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing/invalid reservation fields are not identified to the user\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the reservation form with all fields empty produced no reservation and no visible error message (no toast, no field highlighting, no aria-invalid). Submitting with a valid date/time/name/phone but an invalid email (\\\"not-an-email\\\") also silently failed to submit (no navigation, no reservation created, no toast) with no aria-invalid attribute or border/style change on the email field indicating the problem. The form blocks invalid submissions but never communicates why to the user.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify dialog allowed changing time and party size, saved via \\\"Save Changes\\\" and list updated instantly. Cancel action required explicit confirmation via an alertdialog (\\\"Keep Reservation\\\" / \\\"Cancel Reservation\\\") before the cancellation took effect.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Creating a reservation showed an immediate toast \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" and confirmation panel, and the new reservation appeared in Upcoming list without reload. Modifying time/party-size updated the list instantly. Cancelling moved the item from Upcoming to Past instantly, all within the same session with no manual reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Upcoming tab shows status \\\"Upcoming\\\"; Past tab shows the cancelled reservation with status \\\"Cancelled\\\". Each reservation card displays restaurant name, date, time, party size, status, location (neighborhood), and coupon when present (e.g. \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Restaurant list rating is inconsistent with and does not update alongside the detail page rating\", \"actual\": \"Home page list shows Ember & Smoke rating as 4.7 both before and after a new 5-star review was submitted for it, while the restaurant's detail page shows rating 5.0 (average of its two 5-star reviews) with review count (2). Similarly, The Golden Fork shows 4.8 on the list but 4.5 on its detail page (average of its actual reviews: 5 and 4 stars). The list-page rating is a static value disconnected from the review-derived rating shown on the detail page, and submitting a review does not update the list's displayed rating.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
      }
